# Curated skill packages, one per line. The skills CLI installs each entry.
#
# "owner/repo" resolves against github.com. Pin each entry to a tag or a
# commit: owner/repo@v1.2.3. Replace <pin-me> below with a real tag or commit.
#
# For a different git host, use a full URL. The URL names its own host, and a
# ref travels inside the URL. Examples:
#   https://git.my-company.local/platform/skills.git
#   git@git.my-company.local:platform/skills.git
#
# obra/superpowers@<pin-me>
# ayghri/i-have-adhd@<pin-me>
# wagglebot/skills@<pin-me>
